  "notes": "Fluent Reader (Electron RSS reader) styled with Microsoft Fluent UI: Windows title bar with minimize/maximize/close inside the page, warm off-white #faf9f8 content and #edebe9 nav pane, Segoe UI. Selected nav item marked with a thin blue left bar. Articles alternate between text-only and left-thumbnail layouts (magazine view); read articles are rendered entirely in gray text, unread ones have an orange dot before the relative timestamp. Colored square favicons identify each source in both nav and list. Opening an article shows a large centered modal reader with prev/next arrows and toolbar (read toggle, star, text/full-content mode, web view, more). Unread counts decrement on open."
